[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 43 Hurry up!",
    "start": 1.53,
    "end": 5.072,
    "zh": "第43课 快点！",
    "zh_hant": "第43課 快點！"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.093,
    "end": 9.994,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "How do you know Sam doesn't make the tea very often?",
    "start": 12.116,
    "end": 15.877,
    "zh": "你怎么知道萨姆不常泡茶？",
    "zh_hant": "你怎麼知道薩姆不常泡茶？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Can you make the tea, Sam?",
    "start": 18.219,
    "end": 20.44,
    "zh": "萨姆，你会泡茶吗？",
    "zh_hant": "薩姆，你會泡茶嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Yes, of course I can, Penny.",
    "start": 21.12,
    "end": 23.801,
    "zh": "是的，我当然会，彭妮。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我當然會，彭妮。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Is there any water in this kettle?",
    "start": 25.922,
    "end": 28.524,
    "zh": "这个水壶里有水吗？",
    "zh_hant": "這個水壺裡有水嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Yes, there is.",
    "start": 29.144,
    "end": 30.565,
    "zh": "有，有水。",
    "zh_hant": "有，有水。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Where's the tea?",
    "start": 31.805,
    "end": 33.386,
    "zh": "茶叶在哪儿？",
    "zh_hant": "茶葉在哪兒？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "It's over there, behind the teapot.",
    "start": 34.527,
    "end": 37.868,
    "zh": "就在那边，茶壶后面。",
    "zh_hant": "就在那邊，茶壺後面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Can you see it?",
    "start": 38.209,
    "end": 39.549,
    "zh": "你能看见吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你能看見嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I can see the teapot, but I",
    "start": 40.69,
    "end": 44.152,
    "zh": "我能看见茶壶，但我",
    "zh_hant": "我能看見茶壺，但我"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "can't see the tea.",
    "start": 43.802,
    "end": 45.393,
    "zh": "看不见茶叶。",
    "zh_hant": "看不見茶葉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "There it is!",
    "start": 46.214,
    "end": 47.734,
    "zh": "在那儿！",
    "zh_hant": "在那兒！"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "It's in front of you!",
    "start": 48.255,
    "end": 49.956,
    "zh": "就在你面前！",
    "zh_hant": "就在你面前！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Ah yes, I can see it now.",
    "start": 50.697,
    "end": 54.399,
    "zh": "啊，是的，我现在能看见了。",
    "zh_hant": "啊，是的，我現在能看見了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Where are the cups?",
    "start": 56.18,
    "end": 58.281,
    "zh": "杯子在哪儿？",
    "zh_hant": "杯子在哪兒？"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "There are some in the cupboard.",
    "start": 59.302,
    "end": 61.743,
    "zh": "橱柜里有一些。",
    "zh_hant": "櫥櫃裡有一些。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Can you find them?",
    "start": 63.165,
    "end": 64.585,
    "zh": "你能找到它们吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你能找到它們嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 65.666,
    "end": 66.426,
    "zh": "能。",
    "zh_hant": "能。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Here they are.",
    "start": 66.587,
    "end": 67.887,
    "zh": "它们在这儿。",
    "zh_hant": "它們在這兒。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Hurry up, Sam!",
    "start": 68.368,
    "end": 69.828,
    "zh": "快点，萨姆！",
    "zh_hant": "快點，薩姆！"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "The kettle's boiling!",
    "start": 70.309,
    "end": 72.25,
    "zh": "水壶开了！",
    "zh_hant": "水壺開了！"
  }
]
